Use the page library.
Use the foundation and lettering chapters.
Inscribe "Aé!" at 4 by 4.
For example, the pixel of Screen at 5 by 4 is 3.
For example, the pixel of Screen at 10 by 4 is 3.
For example, the pixel of Screen at 13 by 3 is 3.
For example, the pixel of Screen at 18 by 4 is 3.
Inscribe "A" at -2 by -8.
Caption "HELLO TRAINER! THIS IS A SECOND LINE.".
For example, the pixel of Screen at 0 by 96 is 3.
For example, the pixel of Screen at 8 by 104 is 3.
For example, the pixel of Screen at 9 by 120 is 3.
For example, the pixel of Screen at 157 by 105 is 0.
For example, the caption line of "HELLO TRAINER! THIS IS A SECOND LINE." is "HELLO TRAINER! THIS".
For example, the caption remainder for "HELLO TRAINER! THIS IS A SECOND LINE. AND MORE TO SAY." is "AND MORE TO SAY.".
For example, the caption remainder for "SHORT LINE" is "".
For example, the caption remainder for "1234567890123456789012345678901234567890END" is "90END".
